Package: darling-lol
Version: @VERSION@
Section: contrib/otherosfs
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: darling-lol maintainers <@MAINTAINER@>
Homepage: https://github.com/QuinsZouls/darling-lol
Depends: @DEPS@
Conflicts: @CONFLICTS@
Breaks: darling (<< 999), darling-core (<< 999)
Replaces: darling, darling-core
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: macOS translation layer patched for League of Legends
 Pinned and patched Darling runtime, built at prefix /usr.
 .
 This package contains the translation layer itself: the darling(1) CLI
 (setuid root, required by the runtime), darlingserver, and the 587 MB
 macOS guest tree under /usr/libexec/darling.
 .
 It does NOT contain the League of Legends launcher glue; install
 darling-lol-launcher for that. It also does not create or own
 ~/.darling -- the darling CLI builds that per-user prefix on first run.
 .
 Upstream Darling: https://www.darlinghq.org/ (GPL-3.0-or-later,
 Apple Public Source License 2.0 for the macOS-derived parts).
